on, negative weather, beautiful 3 days hot sunny, 4 days mixture rain sun, totally bad day did swim rain nicer sun shining.we brought lots href=,  ",4,2146,ordered room service day toast tea early morning couple bottles wine cheese crackers late afternoon,staff_service,positive,0.0,neutral
